                                "example_id": "0674be5b-4a93-4f50-af09-1f888f5849e8",
                                "sense_id": "1314ae20-e960-3766-9cc6-e46a6a61dfc7",
                                "text": "Eftir his ingoing to England, he strypit himselff of his apperell, clothed himselff in ane base servill sute, denyit his name, and became servand to ane gairdner, and laborit in gardenes and yairdis during the haill space of his absence;"
                            },
                            {
